fixture door_walk_back_returns_through_the_same_door
doc docs/adr/0014: through door_a's right door into door_b, then straight back: the pair leads back to just inside door_a's door, at the same height
room test/door_a
spawn 1100 416
frames 70
input
  0..19 R
  20..69 L
end
expect
  at 16 event.room=1 room=test_door_b
  mark back 21..69 event.room=1
  at back room=test_door_a x=1206u y=416u ground=1
